Most elves encountered outside their homes are warriors; the information presented here is for one of 1st level.','{"full_attack":"Rapier +3 melee (1d6+1/18–20) or hand crossbow +2 ranged (1d4/19–20)","statblock":{"hit_dice":"1d8 (4 hp)","hit_points":4,"base_attack_grapple":"+1/+2","attack":"Rapier +3 melee (1d6+1/18–20) or hand crossbow +2 ranged (1d4/19–20)","full_attack":"Rapier +3 melee (1d6+1/18–20) or hand crossbow +2 ranged (1d4/19–20)","space_reach":"5 ft./5 ft.","saves":"Fort +2, Ref +1, Will –1*","abilities":{"str":"13","dex":"13","con":"10","int":"12","wis":"9","cha":"10"},"skills":"Hide +0, Listen +2, Search +4, Spot +3","feats":"Weapon Focus (rapier)","special_attacks":"Poison, spell-like abilities","special_qualities":"Drow traits, spell resistance 12"},"source_file":"monsters-e-f.md","source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md"}'::jsonb,'https://olimot.github.io/srd-v3.5/monsters/monsters-e-f.html',true),
